I have the same problem with my Revo7.1 on the left speaker.
I was created diff from proc filesystem.

Test options:
alsamixer
cp -ar /proc/asound procfs_before/
alsamixer --> DAC volume 20->22 and 22->20
cp -ar /proc/asound procfs_after/
diff -Nru proc_before proc_after

diff is attached.

